jei.danknull.desc=The /dank/null is a spiritual successor and upgraded version of the OpenBlocks /dev/null/.
jei.danknull.desc0=\nThe §4§lRedstone§r /dank/null (MK I) is the lowest tier with 9 slots and up to 2 stacks in each slot.
jei.danknull.desc1=\nThe §9§lLapis§r /dank/null (MK II) is the 2nd tier with 18 slots and up to 4 stacks in each slot.
jei.danknull.desc2=\nThe §8§lIron§r /dank/null (MK III) is the 3rd tier with 27 slots and up to 8 stacks in each slot.
jei.danknull.desc3=\nThe §6§lGold§r /dank/null (MK IV) is the 4th tier with 36 slots and up to 16 stacks in each slot.
jei.danknull.desc4=\nThe §b§lDiamond§r /dank/null (MK IV) is the 5th tier with 45 slots and up to 32 stacks in each slot.
jei.danknull.desc5=The §2§lEmerald§r /dank/null (MK VI) is the top tier with 54 slots and up to 2.14 billion of an item per slot.
jei.danknull_dock.desc=-Right-click with /dank/null in-hand to place /dank/null in docking station\n-Items can only be extracted from the /dank/null, not inserted-from bottom.\n-Speed is determined by block that is pulling from the dock.
